<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:normal; color:#111111;">
  Your password was changed
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hello <%= @resource.name %>,</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  The password for <strong><%= @resource.email %></strong> has just been changed.
</p>

<p style="margin:0; font-size:13px; color:#5a5a58;">
  If this was not you, reset your password immediately and contact
  <%= Rails.configuration.x.support_email %>.
</p>
